  "goodToKnow": "Der Stiefvater is a stepfather. Stief- (step-) originally meant bereaved or orphaned. Other step relatives: die Stiefmutter, der Stiefsohn, die Stieftochter, die Stiefgeschwister. Blended families are often called Patchworkfamilien. Because of fairy-tale stepmothers, etwas stiefmütterlich behandeln means to neglect something. Plural: die Stiefväter."
